WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:01,950
We are all here

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:05,190
Let me tell you a few things. Chen Yao, you are in good health.

3
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:07,430
Don't worry, I'll keep an eye on you at the campground.

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:08,510
What I want to say today

5
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,710
It's just about the camp

6
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,350
Been sick these days

7
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,870
I've been thinking about one thing

8
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,350
A dozen of us young people

9
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,390
I thought I could rely on my own hands

10
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:20,470
If you survive well, what will happen?

11
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:24,080
It's not easy for anyone if it's like this now. What do you want to say?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,120
from today

13
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,520
Not sold by head

14
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,520
Who works and who eats

15
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,760
How much to do and how much to eat

16
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,480
Everything is fair, just and open

17
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,560
This rule is reliable

18
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,280
You have the final say whether you do more or less.

19
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,600
Better than evenly divided and hungry

20
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,000
Or maybe Su Weiwei and the others are not evenly divided into strong ones?

21
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,320
Me I can do it too

22
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,880
He can do any job, why not pick Chen Yao?

23
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,480
Are you trying to deal with Lin Feng's method?

24
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:50,340
His method works very well, doesn’t it? Chen Yao

25
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,500
Turn your arms and hands outward

26
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,780
Turn Weiwei on my way to life, my life

27
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,500
I'm very grateful that you bowed your head to get it back, but

28
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,420
Since I have lowered my head

29
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:00,820
Why can't the rules be changed?
